            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz bloku kodu zatrzymaj pętlę po wykonaniu jej bloku kodu, ustawiając <code>isOn</code> na <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isOn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isOn {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Now Playing: Yummy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" isOn = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Now Playing: Yummy\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
